WEBVTT

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.504
even though that clearly is very fun.

00:05:01.422 --> 00:05:05.843
But this is another reason to why
there should be many different metaverses.

00:05:05.885 --> 00:05:09.889
My dream is that there will be a huge
and diverse set of metaverses.

00:05:10.306 --> 00:05:14.602
Having millions of metaverses
with different strengths and focuses

00:05:14.602 --> 00:05:18.272
enables everyone to find
virtual places they love,

00:05:18.314 --> 00:05:19.523
feel welcome in

00:05:19.523 --> 00:05:21.734
and just can have so much fun in.

00:05:22.943 --> 00:05:27.198
We live in a time where almost everything
seems to depend on statistics,

00:05:27.198 --> 00:05:28.407
metrics and diagrams,

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:30.951
and we can for sure learn a lot from this.